        "title": "Dad on the Night Crusher",
        "properties": {
          "title": "Dad on the Night Crusher",
          "location": "Dining Room",
          "charactersPresent": "",
          "text": "Boy: Who is the Night Crusher?\nDad: He keeps the yard. He keeps the hours. He's not cruel, but he's very strong.\nDad: He hears footfalls, not voices. When the ground shakes, stop. Walk on your toes. Breathe through your nose.\nDad: Do that and he'll pass you by.",
