        "title": "Out the Back Door",
        "properties": {
          "title": "Out the Back Door",
          "location": "Back Field",
          "charactersPresent": "",
          "text": "The back door swings shut behind you. The dust is so thick it tastes like chalk.\nThe orange glow sits low on the horizon. It's dimmer than it was yesterday.\nFar away across the field, a white house is lit up like a lantern. You've never been able to reach it.\nAhead, the corn begins.",
