        "title": "The Night Crusher",
        "properties": {
          "title": "The Night Crusher",
          "location": "Corn Maze",
          "charactersPresent": "",
          "text": "The corn parts. A hand the size of a wagon wheel closes around you.\nIt isn't rough. It's patient.\nNight Crusher: Time.\nThe ground opens and you go down with him into the dark.",
