          "location": "Night Crusher's Burrow",
          "charactersPresent": "",
          "text": "You wake on a thin pallet with a clean white sheet. Coal glows in the wall.\nThe Night Crusher sits hunched in the corner with his back to you, like he's giving you privacy.\nDown here you don't feel tired anymore. Just very small.\nNight Crusher: Rest. Then up you go.",
