        "title": "The House Is Bigger",
        "properties": {
          "title": "The House Is Bigger",
          "location": "The Closet",
          "charactersPresent": "",
          "text": "You wake on the quilt under the stairs. You feel worn thin, like a shirt washed too many times.\nThe hallway outside the closet is longer than it was. There's a new door at the end of it.\nBehind the door, a boy is crying. He sounds like you.\nYou reach for the knob. The door slams in your face.\nDad: Back out, boy. The corn's still waiting.",
